# Phase 8 Master Implementation Plan: Full-Stack Flask Web Application Platform

This master implementation plan details the complete end-to-end execution of **Phase 8** — building the **Supply Chain AI Analytics Command Center Web Platform**.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Phase 8 unifies all previous project components (ML Models, Time Series, Data Pipelines, Power BI) into a single, production-grade web application.
> It includes **5 outstanding enterprise capabilities**:
> 1. **Live Explainable AI (SHAP XAI Factor Breakdown)** on ML prediction forms.
> 2. **Batch CSV File Upload & 1,000-Order Inference Engine** with downloadable predictions.
> 3. **Standalone Interactive Chart.js Visual Analytics Hub**.
> 4. **Automated Operational Decision & Supply Chain Alert Engine**.
> 5. **Interactive REST API Documentation & JSON Tester Portal (`/api/docs`)**.

