## Proposed Changes

### Component 1: Flask Web Server & REST API Backend (`web_app/`)

#### [NEW] [app.py](file:///c:/Users/Shubham/Desktop/DSProject/web_app/app.py)
- Flask web application handling Web Page Routes and REST API Endpoints.
- Pre-loads all ML models (`models/*.pkl`) and scalers at startup.
- **REST APIs**:
  - `POST /api/predict/late-risk`: XGBoost classifier prediction + SHAP feature importance calculation.
  - `POST /api/predict/duration`: Linear Regressor shipping duration prediction.
  - `POST /api/predict/customer-segment`: K-Means RFM persona classification.
  - `POST /api/predict/batch`: Multipart CSV upload processor running batch inference on uploaded orders and generating summary statistics + output CSV download.

