## Verification Plan

### Automated Verification
- Boot Flask web server via `python run_app.py`.
- Run REST API tests via `curl` / `requests` for `/api/predict/late-risk`, `/api/predict/duration`, `/api/predict/customer-segment`, and `/api/predict/batch`.

### Manual Verification
- Test all web pages in browser (`/`, `/dashboard`, `/predict/late-risk`, `/predict/duration`, `/predict/customer-segment`, `/predict/batch`, `/recommendations`, `/api/docs`).
- Submit single prediction form and verify SHAP XAI breakdown rendering.
- Upload a test CSV file on `/predict/batch` and verify batch risk summary chart and output CSV download.
